    <td colspan='2' style='font-size:8pt;'><strong>Servicios:</strong> Fractura, Coiled Tubing, Wireline, Snubbing, Well Testing, Cementaci&oacute;n, Flowback, Torqueo, Water Transfer, Log&iacute;stica, Obra Civil y Supervisi&oacute;n General.</td>
